          "text": "Well... There are dozens of sports I could talk about, but now I compare jogging, (one of my favorite hobbies,) and soccer. Both of them have been loved by a large number of people who care about their health, but they are somewhat different in many ways. As for jogging, it is well-known as one of the best forms of cardio exercise (that helps avoid obesity). (Moreover, there is no constraint on time, location, or clothing.) In terms of soccer, it’s obvious physical strength and sociability can be formed and enhanced. I believe even though their characteristics are somewhat similar, both of them pursue a distinct goal in exercise. These are the similarities and differences between jogging and soccer.",
