          "text": "Let me see… the time related to weather…… well…. As far as I remember, it happened at Dongtan beach which has become popular thanks to the movie recorded there. My wife and I went there in order to beat the heat/recharge our batteries/enjoy vacation/relax. We got there and were having a ball hitting the water. However, the weather was completely unexpected. The flood warning was issued, and to make things worse, there was a flood in the streets. In the end, we had to go back home with the wet clothes on. I’ve never seen such a strong thunderstorm in my life.",
